{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S01、S06等段落的非定时感受词仍然偏密，快速扫读时不如Y的右侧短词栏轻松。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"平\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的优势在于话语重点加亮、感受文字弱化，以及部分感受随音乐进程出现，观众比较容易分清人物心理转折和音乐表现之间的关系。尤其是S03至S07的愤懑、怀念、孤独与重新动摇，以及S09至S13从反复纠结到带着想念继续生活的变化，X交代得更细致、更有因果，也更能让人感受到情绪的层次。Y确实更简洁，但右侧短词容易成为并列的感受标签，音乐情绪的先后变化和人物为什么产生这些感受，不如X清楚。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "752119da-6da7-40eb-9292-56d2636c33d3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T061459838574Z", "elapsed_seconds": 90.141, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T06:16:30.002380+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "73d84fff1a89a2c1b83a0cd635b31626afdc7b3a8b188d3f193a5efc44503e38", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\